      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a very heavy burden to carry the belief that you've ruined everything for them. But look at it this way: your existence is the proof of their effort, not the failure of it. They poured their lives into you, and that love doesn't vanish because you're struggling right now. You are not a shadow; you are a person who deserves to be seen, even when you feel like you're falling apart.",
